<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Split</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>split &lt;coin&gt;
split all
</pre>
<p>Examples:
</p>
<pre>split gold
split all
</pre>
<p>Shares out the money you carry among the members of your group who are in 
the room with you, as evenly as the coins allow (see <a cmd='#'>Help Groups</a>). Name 
the kind of coin to share: iron, copper, silver, gold or platinum; or all, 
to share every kind. Each member gets their part, and you keep yours and 
whatever is left over.
</p><p>You must be in a group: split alone, and you only play greedily with your 
money. If there are fewer coins than people, they can't be shared out 
evenly.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Groups</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Money</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Follow</a>
</pre>




</div>